"Where is AI?"

Students identify AI systems they interact with every day and classify:

What the AI does
It provides a prediction based off data it was given.
What data it uses
Whatever data was given to it by the creator.
What business problem it solves
It is able to make predictions much faster than a person.
Who benefits
Whoever was looking for the data it spits out.
What could go wrong
It could give false data because it might not understand your input or misinterpret the data it is given.
